 "premise": "A Japanese teen obsessed with becoming a secret mastermind is reborn in a fantasy world as Cid Kagenou. Playing at being 'Shadow', he invents a sinister Cult of Diablos to recruit an elf girl and others into his organization, Shadow Garden, only for the cult he made up to turn out to be real. The comedy comes from his followers taking his fantasy deadly seriously.",
 "life_message": "It plays with the fantasy of hidden power and coolness, gently mocking the self-absorbed dream of being the secret hero.",
